<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Heavy up on good earnings.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Heavy up on good earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mitsubishi Heavy Industries Ltd gained on Friday morning after the company reported on Thursday that its profits increased in the six months to September 30, traders said.</p>
<p>The share's price was up 11 yen at 886 yen as of 0112 GMT, on volume of 1.455 million shares.</p>
<p>The major heavy machinery maker said on Thursday that its parent current profits grew to 89.14 billion yen for the six-month period from 79.17 billion yen in the previous period.</p>
